Test of red/black shifts for typewriter
// This test types "The quick brown fox jumped over the lazy dog"
// with the words in alternating red and black, beginning with red.
// It halts after each line and can be continued to print another line.

100/
top,
    lac [msg
    jda typetext
    hlt
    jmp top

msg,
text "\RThe\B quick \Rbrown\B fox \Rjumped\B over \Rthe\B lazy \Rdog\B\n"
    013

#include <TYO/typetext.ac>

constants
start 100
